				"{\"muted\":false,\"volume_db\":0,\"task_markers\":[],\"task_overview\":false,\"tracks\":[{\"id\":\"c64f6cef-34eb-4602-820a-defc4ced0f45\",\"name\":\"Task 0\",\"type\":\"task\",\"task_mode\":\"default\",\"color\":\"var(--multitrack-task-bg)\",\"muted\":false,\"solo\":false,\"volume_db\":0,\"locked\":false,\"segments\":[{\"id\":\"2b149dc8-8909-4aca-ba45-6056a98f5476\",\"start_frame\":0,\"end_frame\":192,\"color\":\"var(--multitrack-task-bg)\",\"content\":{\"media_type\":\"none\",\"task_mode\":\"ref\",\"continuity_mode\":\"shot\",\"ref_image_size\":\"max\",\"images\":[{\"id\":\"251f2923-7439-4c4b-97f7-4139247f8de4\",\"source_type\":\"input\",\"file_path\":\"dc238cb39e989449f51b778033a35e737edfd84de6a794e614c35040c8aaa642.png\",\"file_name\":\"dc238cb39e989449f51b778033a35e737edfd84de6a794e614c35040c8aaa642.png\",\"shared_reference\":true}],\"muted\":false,\"volume_db\":0,\"user_prompt\":\"subject_definitions:\\n<Subject 1> is the young woman from <Picture 1>.\\n\\nsummary:\\n[reference generation] A widescreen 16:9 live-action clip at dusk, third-person. The camera glides behind <Subject 1> as she sprints downhill through a dark pine forest; at the bottom of the slope a black cave mouth set into a rocky hillside is clearly visible ahead of her and grows closer as she runs. The clip ends with her still running, a few strides short of the entrance.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - face, hair and outfit follow <Picture 1> exactly, no change of clothing, hairstyle or accessories.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, widescreen 16:9, shallow depth of field, fine film grain, one continuous take. The camera is third-person, gliding directly BEHIND <Subject 1>, a medium shot from the top of her head down to her waist, at a fixed short distance, matching her running pace exactly, with slight handheld motion and the rhythmic bounce of a running camera. We see her back, her hair and shoulders, and the space opening up ahead of her. The camera never swings around to face her. Dusk: a cold grey-blue light under heavy cloud, the last of the day failing between the trunks. \\n\\n00:00.000-00:03.500: Seen from behind at head-to-waist, <Subject 1> sprints downhill through tall dry grass and ferns between dark pine trunks, arms driving, hair whipping, feet crashing through dead leaves. The camera follows directly behind her, matching her speed, the slope falling away ahead of her. In the distance, at the bottom of the slope, a low black cave mouth set into a wall of grey rock is clearly visible straight ahead on her path.\\n\\n00:03.500-00:08.000: She keeps running at the same hard pace down the slope toward the cave mouth, which grows steadily larger directly ahead of her, the pines thinning to exposed rock and roots on both sides. The opening is solid flat black: no light inside it, no shape visible within it, nothing of the far side showing through. The clip ends with her still running straight at the same pace, several strides short of the entrance, nothing else in progress.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nHarsh breathing and footfalls, boots crashing through dry grass and dead leaves, branches brushing her clothing, low wind moving through the high pines, a faint distant caw of birds. No music.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nA low, slow, tense ambient pulse under everything, barely above silence, building very gradually.\"}},{\"id\":\"8c043c0e-9b1f-4fa4-96c7-96d4f2d4e98f\",\"start_frame\":192,\"end_frame\":384,\"color\":\"var(--multitrack-task-bg)\",\"content\":{\"media_type\":\"none\",\"task_mode\":\"default\",\"continuity_mode\":\"context\",\"ref_image_size\":\"match\",\"images\":[{\"id\":\"2eb016c2-b681-42e4-8391-05f405bbf84f\",\"source_type\":\"input\",\"file_path\":\"dc238cb39e989449f51b778033a35e737edfd84de6a794e614c35040c8aaa642.png\",\"file_name\":\"dc238cb39e989449f51b778033a35e737edfd84de6a794e614c35040c8aaa642.png\",\"shared_reference\":true,\"shared_reference_copy\":true}],\"muted\":false,\"volume_db\":0,\"user_prompt\":\"subject_definitions:\\n<Subject 1> is the young woman from <Picture 1>.\\n\\nsummary:\\n[reference generation] A widescreen 16:9 live-action clip continuing without any break, third-person from behind. <Subject 1> runs into the black cave mouth and as she runs deeper a row of glass fish tanks set into the rock walls ignites one by one ahead of her and goes dark again behind her. The clip ends with her running on through the lit passage, a large cold blue glow growing in the deep tunnel ahead.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - face, hair and outfit follow <Picture 1> exactly, no change of clothing, hairstyle or accessories.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, widescreen 16:9, shallow depth of field, fine film grain, one continuous take. The camera is third-person, gliding directly BEHIND <Subject 1>, a medium shot from the top of her head down to her waist, at a fixed short distance, matching her running pace exactly, with slight handheld motion and the rhythmic bounce of a running camera. We see her back, her hair and shoulders, and the space opening up ahead of her. The camera never swings around to face her. \\n\\nThe video opens already in progress, mid-stride, at full running pace. The camera is exactly where it already is, gliding directly behind <Subject 1> at head-to-waist at the same distance, matching her speed, her back and shoulders in the same position in frame. She keeps running at exactly the same pace through the space she is already in, the same surfaces passing on both sides at the same rate, the same light on her unchanged, her stride rhythm unbroken. For the first two seconds nothing changes: no new object enters frame, the light does not shift, she does not stop, slow down, turn around or reach for anything. 00:02.920-00:04.420: Ahead of her the black cave mouth arrives and she runs straight through it; the interior opens around her. The rock walls are set with dozens of thick glass fish tanks built flush into the stone at chest and head height, visible over her shoulders on both sides, all of them dark and empty-looking as she comes in.\\n\\n00:04.420-00:08.000: As she runs, the tanks light up ahead of her one at a time and go dark again behind her, so a pool of glowing water travels with her down the tunnel, seen past her back and shoulders. Each tank is a different world behind the glass - pale coral, drifting green weed, small silver fish - and each lights with its own character, one swelling warm gold, the next striking cold blue with a flicker, the next humming up through violet. Lit tanks glow ahead, she passes into them, they fade to black behind. The passage keeps descending and opening, and at its far end a single much larger cold blue glow sits low and steady, growing brighter ahead of her. The clip ends with her still running at the same pace toward that distant blue light, nothing else in progress.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nHer footfalls shift from forest floor to hard ringing stone, echoing down the tunnel. A steady drip of water, her quick hard breathing, the wet glassy hum of the tanks as they ignite. Each tank lights with its own small sound - a soft whoomph, an electrical click, a rising liquid thrum - as it wakes ahead of her and fades behind her.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nContinuing the same low tense pulse at the same slow tempo without a new entry or a build, growing faintly fuller as the tanks wake.\"}},{\"id\":\"9265d716-790a-451a-a82e-7c80e6fc6ab9\",\"start_frame\":384,\"end_frame\":576,\"color\":\"var(--multitrack-task-bg)\",\"content\":{\"media_type\":\"none\",\"task_mode\":\"ref\",\"continuity_mode\":\"context\",\"ref_image_size\":\"max\",\"images\":[{\"id\":\"23ec35f2-bf90-4e84-a21d-c000e5f1ac03\",\"source_type\":\"input\",\"file_path\":\"dc238cb39e989449f51b778033a35e737edfd84de6a794e614c35040c8aaa642.png\",\"file_name\":\"dc238cb39e989449f51b778033a35e737edfd84de6a794e614c35040c8aaa642.png\",\"shared_reference\":true,\"shared_reference_copy\":true}],\"muted\":false,\"volume_db\":0,\"user_prompt\":\"subject_definitions:\\n<Subject 1> is the young woman from <Picture 1>.\\n\\nsummary:\\n[reference generation] A widescreen 16:9 live-action clip continuing without any break, third-person from behind. <Subject 1> runs the last stretch toward the growing blue glow, which resolves into a vast chamber holding one enormous curved fish tank built into the rock with a single large shark inside. She slows to a stop before the glass, the camera still behind her, the giant tank and shark filling the view past her shoulders.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - face, hair and outfit follow <Picture 1> exactly, no change of clothing, hairstyle or accessories.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, widescreen 16:9, shallow depth of field, fine film grain, one continuous take. The camera is third-person, gliding directly BEHIND <Subject 1>, a medium shot from the top of her head down to her waist, at a fixed short distance, matching her running pace exactly, with slight handheld motion and the rhythmic bounce of a running camera. We see her back, her hair and shoulders, and the space opening up ahead of her. The camera never swings around to face her. \\n\\nThe video opens already in progress, mid-stride, at full running pace. The camera is exactly where it already is, gliding directly behind <Subject 1> at head-to-waist at the same distance, matching her speed, her back and shoulders in the same position in frame. She keeps running at exactly the same pace through the space she is already in, the same surfaces passing on both sides at the same rate, the same light on her unchanged, her stride rhythm unbroken. For the first two seconds nothing changes: no new object enters frame, the light does not shift, she does not stop, slow down, turn around or reach for anything. 00:02.920-00:04.920: The row of small tanks falls away and ahead of her the tunnel opens into a vast low-ceilinged rock chamber. The cold blue glow is one enormous curved fish tank built into the far rock face, taller than she is, filled with deep blue water, lit from within, its spill washing the wet walls in moving water-light, filling the view over her shoulders. The last few small tanks along the passage wake as she passes and dim behind her.\\n\\n00:04.920-00:07.000: Inside the giant tank a single large shark swims slowly through the blue, its pale belly and dark back catching the light as it turns, clearly visible past her back. <Subject 1> runs the last few strides and slows to a stop before the glass, the camera stopping behind her at head-to-waist, her shoulders at the bottom of frame and the huge glowing tank and the shark filling everything above and ahead of them. Her shoulders rise and fall with heavy breathing. At 00:06.200 she breathes, barely a whisper: [speaking, English, breathless and awed, almost inaudible, facing away from the camera] \\\"Oh my god.\\\"\\n\\n00:07.000-00:08.000: She stays standing before the glass, one hand rising slowly toward it, as the shark glides slowly past, the whole chamber lit only by its blue glow, her breathing the only movement.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nHer footfalls on ringing stone slowing and stopping, a huge hollow resonant chamber echo on every sound. The deep pressurized thrum of the giant tank, water moving heavily inside it, a low sub-bass tremor as the shark passes. Her breathing loud and close, settling from a run into a held, awed breath.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nContinuing the same low pulse, now swelling into a slow ominous swell as the chamber and the shark are revealed, then hanging unresolved as the clip ends.\"}}]},{\"id\":\"d15f065c-25c4-4922-8570-01dde0d3caf0\",\"name\":\"Video 0\",\"type\":\"video\",\"color\":\"var(--primary)\",\"muted\":false,\"solo\":false,\"volume_db\":0,\"locked